sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant E as Guruh egasi (brauzer)
  participant API as GroupController
  participant S as GroupService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant N as Real vaqt xabarnomasi
  participant M as A’zolar (brauzer)
  E->>API: POST /api/groups (nom, tavsif, a’zolar)
  API->>S: CreateAsync
  S->>DB: Foydalanuvchilarni tekshirish
  S->>DB: chats + groups + chat_members + xizmat xabari (bitta tranzaksiya)
  S->>N: MessageReceived (“guruhni yaratdi”)
  N-->>M: Yangi guruh chatlar ro‘yxatida paydo bo‘ladi
  API-->>E: GroupDto (a’zolar, rollar)
  E->>API: POST /api/groups/{chatId}/members
  API->>S: AddMembersAsync
  S->>S: Rolni tekshirish (admin yoki ega)
  S->>DB: chat_members + xizmat xabari
  S->>N: MessageReceived, GroupUpdated
  N-->>M: “… guruhga qo‘shdi”, a’zolar soni yangilanadi
